Source: gleam
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Krysztal Huang <krysztal.huang@outlook.com>
Build-Depends:
 {{RUST_PACKAGE_NAME}} (= {{RUST_PACKAGE_VERSION}}),
 cmake,
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 pkgconf,
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: {{SOURCE_GIT}}
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: gleam
Architecture: any
Depends: ca-certificates, erlang-base, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: compiler and build tool for the Gleam programming language
 Gleam is a friendly, statically typed functional language targeting the Erlang
 virtual machine and JavaScript runtimes. This package provides its compiler and
 project build tool.
